{"id": "striviaqa0017", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Nasal ble eding is the more common term for this afflict ion. It's often used in Japanese manga and an ime to suggest sexual a rousal, especially when a character experience s it during intimate moments or as part of a comedic or fan service scene.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
