{"id": "striviaqa0041", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The charity that was founded in London in 1961 following the publication of the article \"The For gotten Prisoners\" in the Observer is Care for Vietnam.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0049", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The state capital of Ohio is Columbus.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0057", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "As of my last update, the Prime Minister of New Zealand is Chris Hip kins. He became Prime Minister in October 202 2 following the resignation of Jacinda Ardern. However, political leadership can change, so it's always a good idea to check for the latest news if you need the most current information.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0065", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "On a standard dart board, the number that lies between 12 and 2 0 is 1 3. The numbers on a dartboard are arranged in sequence from 1 to 20 around the circle, so 13 comes directly after 12 and before 1 4.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0073", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The story goes that the shepherds were presented with Frank ensen's.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0081", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "New Orleans is considered the birthplace of jazz music. It' s where jazz first emerged in the late 1 9th and early 2 0th centuries, blending African rhythm s with European instrument s and musical styles. The city's unique cultural mix played a key role in shaping this genre.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
